       "confirm",
       "correct",
       "refuse",
       "pending"
      ],
      "min_confidence": 0.7,
      "extraction_prompt": "Extract only facts expressed by the caller. Do not invent a date, amount, or confirmation from an agent offer. The latest correction replaces the earlier value. Incomplete fragments remain partial until the caller finishes. Only combine fragments across turns when the previous answer was explicitly partial. Ignore unrelated dates in stories. Use zero for an unspecified integer; omit an unspecified optional string. These rules override built-in calendar interpretation: never convert a relative weekday or vague period to a concrete date.\n{{extractor.type_preamble}}\nVariables:\n{{extractor.variables_list}}\nRecent conversation:\n{{extractor.conversation.last-10}}\nCurrent speech:\n{{extractor.speech}}"
     },
